Data
----
Market and economic data shown by the terminal is fetched at run time from
third-party sources (for example Yahoo Finance, U.S. SEC, Federal Reserve, ECB,
BIS, IMF, OECD, EIA, BLS, FRED, CFTC, FINRA, CBOE, U.S. Treasury, IMF PortWatch,
the Caldara-Iacoviello Geopolitical Risk Index, and for government yield curves
Deutsche Bundesbank, Bank of England, Japan's Ministry of Finance, Bank of Canada,
Sveriges Riksbank and Brazil's Tesouro Nacional). Each source has its own terms
of use, rate limits and attribution requirements, and you are responsible for
respecting them. This project does not own, license, redistribute or guarantee
any of that data. Some sources are delayed, incomplete, revised or unavailable.

